<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWA says M.D. Dougall resigns.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWA says M.D. Dougall resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Communications and entertainment company AWA Ltd said on Thursday John Dougall had resigned as managing director, effective immediately.</p>
<p>He had been replaced by group general manager John Rouse, the company said.</p>
</text>
